name=HARMONIE - From Garden to Plate
id=HARMONIE_GardenToPlate
description=Adds a vitamin (A, B, C, D, E, K) micronutrient system on top of the food you eat. Press N (rebindable) to check your own or a nearby survivor's nutritional status -- requires First Aid 5 to interpret the result. Neglect your diet and critical vitamin deficiencies will start to hurt you. Also adds home canning: preserve vegetables and fruit indefinitely in empty tin cans. Also adds a "Vitamins" tab right in the vanilla character info window -- shows Critical/Low/Sufficient at a glance for everyone, plus exact numbers at First Aid 3 and a top-10 food list per vitamin at Cooking 3. If "Moodle Framework" (Workshop 3396446795) is enabled, each vitamin gets its own moodle when Low or Critical. If "Modern Status" (Workshop 3451167732) is enabled, each vitamin becomes a selectable HUD indicator. Both are entirely optional -- neither is required to use this mod.
